[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Conversation" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://game/dialogue/conversation.gd" id="1_convo"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_convo")
id = &"n3_osric"
text = "# DRAFT
# Osric at dusk, in the kitchen (night 3). The cellarer: short and heavy, round red face, always smiling; his ring of keys jingles.
# Jolly; he feeds you extra bread. (He started the killings. Nothing here says so.)
== start
(Osric is at the kitchen fire, sleeves rolled, his ring of keys swinging at his belt. His face is red from the heat.)
Osric: The porter! Come in out of the cold. Mind the pot. You look half starved.
-> topics

== again
Osric: Back again? You can smell supper, can you. Not yet, porter. Not yet.
-> topics

== topics
* [if not n3_osric_bread] (Ask about the bread.) -> bread
* [if not n3_osric_supper] (Ask what is for supper.) -> supper
* [if not n3_osric_page] (Ask if anyone has been at your ledger.) -> page

== bread [set n3_osric_bread]
Osric: My bread? Rye from our own granary, baked in our own oven. Best in the ward.
Osric: There's a bitter crust on it this week. The rye came in damp. It does no harm.
(He laughs, and claps you on the shoulder with a floury hand.)
Osric: I'll keep the heel back for you. A growing lad wants the heel.
-> topics

== supper [set n3_osric_supper]
Osric: Pease pottage, rye bread and small ale. Same as last night, and the night before.
Osric: Father Abbot looks to me like a man about to order a fast. Eat while you can, porter.
-> topics

# Asking the wrong brother the wrong question: Suspicion +5 (design doc).
== page [set n3_osric_page] [suspicion 5]
Osric: Your ledger? Who'd want it? A list of wet pilgrims and their boots.
(He's still smiling. The knife in his hand has stopped.)
Osric: Keep your cell door shut, porter. The cats get in. A cat will eat anything.
-> topics

== leave
Osric: Don't be late for supper! I'll keep the heel back for you.
"
